00:07:26,399 --> 00:07:32,399
Rushmore is a comedy, drama film directed by Wes Anderson.

3
00:11:09,599 --> 00:11:15,599
When a beautiful first-grade teacher arrives at a prep school, she soon attracts the
attention of an ambitious teenager named Max, who quickly falls in love with her.

4
00:14:52,799 --> 00:14:58,799
Max turns to the father of two of his schoolmates
for advice on how to woo the teacher.

5
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:42,000
However, the situation soon gets complicated when Max's new friend becomes involved with
her, setting the two pals against one another in a war for her attention.

6
00:22:19,199 --> 00:22:25,199
Max Fischer, played by Jason Schwartzman.

7
00:26:02,399 --> 00:26:08,399
Herman Blume, played by Bill Murray.

8
00:29:45,599 --> 00:29:51,599
Rosemary Cross, played by Olivia Williams.

9
