Bert Fischer, played by Seymour Cassel.

10
00:37:12,000 --> 00:37:18,000
Dr. Nelson Guggenheim, played by Brian Cox.

11
00:40:55,199 --> 00:41:01,199
Dirk Calloway, played by Mason Gamble.

12
00:44:38,399 --> 00:44:44,399
Rushmore is a 1998 American comedy film  directed by Wes Anderson about a teenager named Max Fischer (Jason Schwartzman in his film debut), his friendship
with rich industrialist Herman Blume (Bill Murray), and their shared affection for elementary school teacher Rosemary Cross (Olivia Williams).

13
00:48:21,599 --> 00:48:27,599
The film was co-written by Anderson and Owen Wilson.

14
00:52:04,799 --> 00:52:10,799
The soundtrack features multiple songs by bands associated
with the British Invasion of the 1960s.

15
00:55:48,000 --> 00:55:54,000
Filming began in November 1997 around Houston, Texas, and
lasted 50 days, until late January 1998.

16
00:59:31,199 --> 00:59:37,199
While the box office results were modest, the film had a
positive reception among film critics.

17
01:03:14,399 --> 01:03:20,399
The film helped launch Schwartzman's career while establishing a "second
career" for Murray as a respected actor in independent cinema.

18
01:06:57,599 --> 01:07:03,599
At the 1999 Independent Spirit Awards, Anderson won the Best
Director award and Murray won Best Supporting Male award.

19
01:10:40,800 --> 01:10:46,800
Murray also earned a nomination for the Golden Globe Award
for Best Supporting Actor – Motion Picture.

20
01:14:24,000 --> 01:14:30,000
Starting from Rushmore, both Murray and Schwartzman became
two of Anderson's most frequent collaborators.

21
01:18:07,199 --> 01:18:13,199
They have appeared in ten and seven subsequent films, respectively.

22
01:21:50,399 --> 01:21:56,399
The film was selected for preservation in the United States National Film Registry by the Library of
Congress in 2016, deemed "culturally, historically, or aesthetically significant".

23
01:25:33,599 --> 01:25:39,599
The film explores themes of lone wolf, private school,
theater play, theatre group, theater director.

24
01:29:16,799 --> 01:29:22,799
The tone is lighthearted and emotional and thought_provoking.
